<div class="header contentPageHeader">




<div class="flex-grid-container oh-content-header">
    <h1 class="row ">Welcome to onemarkets by UniCredit. A reliable partner.</h1>
</div>
</div>

<div class="contentPar parsys">




<div role="banner">
    <div id="oh-hero-banner-carousel" class="oh-carousel carousel slide oh-hero-banner oh-grid-col oh-grid-col-12">
        <div class="oh-carousel-inner carousel-inner">
            
            
                
                
                    
                
            
            
        </div>
        
    </div>
</div><div class="europemap section">



<link rel="stylesheet" href="/etc/designs/onemarkets-relaunch/clientlibs/europemap.min.css" type="text/css"/>
<script src="/etc/designs/onemarkets-relaunch/clientlibs/europemap.min.js"></script>


<div class="europe-map-container flex-grid-container">
    <h2 class="europe-map-title">Our map</h2>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col col-6 europe-map-content">
            <p>UniCredit is a pan-European commercial bank providing a unique service offering in Italy, Germany, Central and Eastern Europe.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>We serve over fifteen million clients in a cohesive manner, connecting them to our thirteen banks. Our purpose is to empower communities to progress, delivering best-in-class products and services to all stakeholders, whilst unlocking the potential of our clients and our people.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>The onemarkets brand demonstrates a collective skillset (“one”) in investment and leverage products, as well as market access worldwide. onemarkets offers a wide range of products, especially in Germany, Austria and in Central and Eastern Europe, which include different levels of risk tolerance, market opinions and investment horizons. This includes investment products with and without capital protection as well as leverage products for more aggressive independent decision-makers.</p>

        </div>
        <div class="col col-6 europe-map-countries">
            <div class="select-label">Select country</div>
            <div class="list-of-countries">
                
                    <div class="country-element" data-country-href="https://www.onemarkets.at/">
                        <div class="triangle"></div>
                        <img src="/etc/designs/onemarkets-relaunch/img/flags/at.svg" height="20px" width="26px"></img>
                        <span class="country-title">Austria</span>
                    </div>
                
                    <div class="country-element" data-country-href="https://www.onemarkets.bg/">
                        <div class="triangle"></div>
                        <img src="/etc/designs/onemarkets-relaunch/img/flags/bg.svg" height="20px" width="26px"></img>
                        <span class="country-title">Bulgaria</span>
                    </div>
                
                    <div class="country-element" data-country-href="https://www.onemarkets.hr/">
                        <div class="triangle"></div>
                        <img src="/etc/designs/onemarkets-relaunch/img/flags/hr.svg" height="20px" width="26px"></img>
                        <span class="country-title">Croatia</span>
                    </div>
                
                    <div class="country-element" data-country-href="https://www.onemarkets.cz">
                        <div class="triangle"></div>
                        <img src="/etc/designs/onemarkets-relaunch/img/flags/cz.svg" height="20px" width="26px"></img>
                        <span class="country-title">Czech Republic</span>
                    </div>
                
                    <div class="country-element" data-country-href="https://www.onemarkets.de/">
                        <div class="triangle"></div>
                        <img src="/etc/designs/onemarkets-relaunch/img/flags/de.svg" height="20px" width="26px"></img>
                        <span class="country-title">Germany</span>
                    </div>
                
                    <div class="country-element" data-country-href="https://www.bourse.unicredit.fr/">
                        <div class="triangle"></div>
                        <img src="/etc/designs/onemarkets-relaunch/img/flags/fr.svg" height="20px" width="26px"></img>
                        <span class="country-title">France</span>
                    </div>
                
                    <div class="country-element" data-country-href="https://www.onemarkets.hu/">
                        <div class="triangle"></div>
